  - m_Id: 3321640247296
    m_Localized: "Convict \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588
      (full name), born 19\u2588\u2588, convicted under Art. \u2588\u2588\u2588 of
      the Criminal Code of the Russian Federation, is directed to serve correctional
      labor in the form of three night shifts cleaning premises, starting 26 October
      2006. Report by 11:00 PM. Failure to complete the required volume of work results
      in a reprimand. A second reprimand results in conversion of the sentence to
      imprisonment."
